1. `tmux list-sessions`
2. `tmux new-session -s <session_name>`
3. `tmux attach-session -t <session_name>`
4. `tmux detach` (inside tmux) or `Ctrl+b d` (keyboard shortcut)
5. `Ctrl+b [` (enter scroll mode) then use arrow keys or `Page Up`/`Page Down` to scroll; press `q` to exit scroll mode
5. `Ctrl+b d` to detach 
